arted in 1976 with Dr. Kenichiro Sugita<\\/strong><br>That\\u2019s when this acclaimed neurosurgeon worked with Mizuho Corporation to develop the famous Sugita Clip for cerebral aneurysm. This breakthrough product went on to become a gold standard and continues to be used in countless ORs worldwide.<\\/p><p>Dr. Sugita continued partnering with Mizuho Corporation, and today Mizuho America proudly offers a full line of Sugita products.<\\/p>\",\"_css_classes\":\"au-collab-text\"},\"elements\":[]},{\"id\":\"0685b48\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"isInner\":false,\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"css_classes\":\"au-sugita\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bdefade\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"image\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":67,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/task-11.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/about-sugita-2.jpg\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"alt\":\"Dr. Kenichiro Sugita\",\"_css_classes\":\"au-sugita-img\"},\"elements\":[]},{\"id\":\"a62bb63\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"heading\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Dr. Kenichiro Sugita\",\"header_size\":\"p\",\"_css_classes\":\"au-sugita-cap\"},\"elements\":[]}]}]},{\"id\":\"54de14a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"button\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Browse the many neurosurgical procedures we support\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"\\/products\\/\",\"is_external\":\"\",\"nofollow\":\"\"},\"size\":\"sm\",\"_css_classes\":\"au-btn au-collab-btn au-m-only\"},\"elements\":[]},{\"id\":\"c35a888\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"heading\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Mizuho America\\u2019s expert collaborators include:\",\"header_size\":\"h2\",\"_css_classes\":\"au-h2 au-h2--nocase au-experts-h\"},\"elements\":[]},{\"id\":\"13ac67e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"isInner\":false,\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"css_classes\":\"au-experts\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7347859\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"isInner\":false,\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"css_classes\":