And that\\\\u2019s really the name of the game is to try and find things, tools, that make you a better surgeon.\\\\u201d<\\\\\\/p><p>\\\\u2013 Michael Lawton, MD<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/blockquote>\\\\n<a href=\\\\\\\"#products\\\\\\\">Discover our wide range of products<\\\\\\/a><a href=\\\\\\\"#video-testimonials\\\\\\\">Watch video testimonials<\\\\\\/a><a href=\\\\\\\"#product-brochures\\\\\\\">Download product brochures<\\\\\\/a><\\\\\\/section>\\\",\\\"__inner_html\\\":\\\"<section id=\\\\\\\"about-closing\\\\\\\"><blockquote><p>\\\\u201cBetter instruments help you get the best patient outcome. And that\\\\u2019s really the name of the game is to try and find things, tools, that make you a better surgeon.\\\\u201d<\\\\\\/p><p>\\\\u2013 Michael Lawton, MD<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/blockquote>\\\\n<a href=\\\\\\\"#products\\\\\\\">Discover our wide range of products<\\\\\\/a><a href=\\\\\\\"#video-testimonials\\\\\\\">Watch video testimonials<\\\\\\/a><a href=\\\\\\\"#product-brochures\\\\\\\">Download product brochures<\\\\\\/a><\\\\\\/section>\\\"},\\\"elements\\\":[],\\\"elType\\\":\\\"widget\\\",\\\"widgetType\\\":\\\"html\\\"}]\",\"_elementor_edit_mode\":\"builder\"}},{\"id\":\"snap-Obvt4Rz1Lt\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-28T09:19:29+00:00\",\"user_id\":1,\"user_login\":\"admin\",\"reason\":\"pre:dev-connect\\/elementor-set-page-data\",\"state\":{\"_elementor_data\":\"[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"fiuezgu\\\",\\\"settings\\\":{\\\"html\\\":\\\"<section id=\\\\\\\"about-hero\\\\\\\"><h1>About us<\\\\\\/h1>\\\\n<img src=\\\\\\\"http:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/task-11.local\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2026\\\\\\/09\\\\\\/about-hero-PLACEHOLDER.jpg\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"Surgeons in an operating room\\\\\\\"><img src=\\\\\\\"http:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/task-11.local\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2026\\\\\\/09\\\\\\/about-hero-portrait.jpg\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"Erol Veznedaroglu, MD\\\\\\\">\\\\n<blockquote><p>\\\\u201cAbout a decade ago I designed a clip and worked in conjunction with Mizuho because I saw a need for my practice.\\\\u201d<\\\\\\/p>\\\\n<p>Erol Veznedaroglu, MD, FACS, FAANS, FAHA<br>President and CEO, Global Neuroscience Institute<br>Professor, Robert A. Groff Chair, Department of Neurosurgery<br>Drexel University College of Medicine<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/blockquote><\\\\\\/section>\\\",\\\"__inner_html\\\":\\\"<section id=\\\\\\\"about-hero\\\\\\\"><h1>About us<\\\\\\/h1>\\\\n<img src=\\\\\\\"http:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/task-11.local\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2026\\\\\\/09\\\\\\/about-hero-PLACEHOLDER.jpg\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"Surgeons in an operating room\\\\\\\"><img src=\\\\\\\"http:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/task-11.local\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2026\\\\\\/09\\\\\\/about-hero-portrait.jpg\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"Erol Veznedaroglu, MD\\\\\\\">\\\\n<blockquote><p>\\\\u201cAbout a decade ago I designed a clip and worked in conjunction with Mizuho because I saw a need for my practice.\\\\u201d<\\\\\\/p>\\\\n<p>Erol Veznedaroglu, MD, FACS, FAANS, FAHA<br>President and CEO, Global Neuroscience Institute<br>Professor, Robert A. Groff Chair, Department of Neurosurgery<br>Drexel University College of Medicine<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/blockquote><\\\\\\/section>\\\"},\\\"elements\\\":[],\\\"elType\\\":\\\"widget\\\",\\\"widgetType\\\":\\\"html\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"9daimzo\\\",\\\"settings\\\":{\\\"html\\\":\\\"<section id=\\\\\\\"about-intro\\\\\\\"><h2>Advanced Neurosurgical tools. Enhanced customer care.<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\n<p>That\\\\u2019s why so many neurosurgeons choose Mizuho America. We\\\\u2019ve built our reputation on high-quality, handcrafted products with patented features backed by exceptional support. We\\\\u2019ve accomplished this through:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\n<ul><li>Collaborations with neurosurgical experts to help fill unmet instrumentation needs in the neurosurgery OR<\\\\\\/li><li>High-performance tools that meet rigorous quality protocols\\\\u2014with no generic designs or mass-production assembly lines<\\\\\\/li><li>A personalized, dedicated partnership with our customers before, during, and after the sale<\\\\\\/li><\\\\\\/ul>\\\\n<div><h3>1993<\\\\\\/h3><p>Mizuho America, Inc. established in Boston, MA (relocated to Union City, CA, in 2010)<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/div>\\\\n<div><h3>1,800+<\\\\\\/h3><p>neurosurgical products, including head-holding systems, instruments, microsurgery tables, and vascular management<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/div>\\\\n<div><h3>ISO 13485<\\\\\\/h3><p>for patient safety, regulatory compliance, traceability &amp; documentation, risk management, and supplier control<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/div>\\\\n<div><h3>1,000+<\\\\\\/h3><p>hospitals served<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/div>\\\\n<p>We\\\\u2019re a global leader in neurosurgery tools, and we\\\\u2019ll continue to maintain the high standards that have earned us the trust of the neurosurgical community. Because we share your same goal: achieving the best outcomes for patients.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\n<a href=\\\\\\\"#clinical-collaborators\\\\\\\">Hear from our clinical collaborators<\\\\\\/a><\\\\\\/section>\\\",\\\"__inner_html\\\":\\\"<section id=\\\\\\\"about-intro\\\\\\\"><h2>Advanced Neurosurgical tools. Enhanced customer care.<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\n<p>That\\\\u2019s why so many neurosurgeons choose Mizuho America. We\\\\u2019ve built our reputation on high-quality, handcrafted products with patented features backed by exceptional support. We\\\\u2019ve accomplished this through:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\n<ul><li>Collaborations with neurosurgical experts to help fill unmet instrumentation needs in the neurosurgery OR<\\\\\\/li><li>High-performance tools that meet rigorous quality protocols\\\\u2014with no generic designs or mass-production assembly lines<\\\\\\/li><li>A personalized, dedicated partnership with our customers before, during, and after the sale<\\\\\\/li><\\\\\\/ul>\\\\n<div><h3>1993<\\\\\\/h3><p>Mizuho America, Inc. established in Boston, MA (relocated to Union City, CA, in 2010)<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/div>\\\\n<div><h3>1,800+<\\\\\\/h3><p>neurosurgical products, including head-holding systems, instruments, microsurgery tables, and vascular management<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/div>\\\\n<div><h3>ISO 13485<\\\\\\/h3><p>for patient safety, regulatory compliance, traceability &amp; documentation, risk management, and supplier control<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/div>\\\\n<div><h3>1,000+<\\\\\\/h3><p>hospitals served<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/div>\\\\n<p>We\\\\u2019re a global leader in neurosurgery tools, and we\\\\u2019ll continue to maintain the high standards that have earned us the trust of the neurosurgical community. Because we share your same goal: achieving the best outcomes for patients.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\n<a href=\\\\\\\"#clinical-collaborators\\\\\\\">Hear from our clinical collaborators<\\\\\\/a><\\\\\\/section>\\\"},\\\"elements\\\":[],\\\"elType\\\":\\\"widget\\\",\\\"widgetType\\\":\\\"html\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"xefbmwv\\\",\\\"settings\\\":{\\\"html\\\":\\\"<section id=\\\\\\\"about-mission\\\\\\\"><h2>Our mission<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\n<p><em>\\\\u201cCollaborate with surgeons to provide high-quality neurosurgical devices in order to help advance surgical techniques to benefit patient health<\\\\\\/em>.\\\\u201d<\\\\\\/p>\\\\n<p>Message from <strong>Hiroshi Nemoto<\\\\\\/strong>, Representative Director President &amp; CEO, Mizuho Global Headquarters<\\\\\\/p>\\\\n<h3>Our corporate creed<\\\\\\/h3><ul><li><img src=\\\\\\\"http:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/task-11.local\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2026\\\\\\/09\\\\\\/creed-honesty.png\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\">Honesty<\\\\\\/li><li><img src=\\\\\\\"http:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/task-11.local\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2026\\\\\\/09\\\\\\/creed-contribution.png\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\">Contribution<\\\\\\/li><li><img src=\\\\\\\"http:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/task-11.local\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/2026\\\\\\/09\\\\\\/creed-solidarity.png\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\">Solidarity<\\\\\\/li><\\\\\\/ul>\\\\n<h3>Our guiding principles<\\\\\\/h3><ul><li><img src=\\\\\\\"http:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/task-11.local\\\\\\/wp-content\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\