ing that disease and getting the job done.” “When you have the right instruments in your hand, then you can just focus on the task and you can focus on, you know, battling that disease and getting the job done.”'),(3899,261,'_sections_6_featured_quote','field_m11_ri_featured_quote'),(3900,261,'sections_6_featured_quote_attribution','Michael T. Lawton, MD Michael T. Lawton, MD'),(3901,261,'_sections_6_featured_quote_attribution','field_m11_ri_featured_quote_attribution'),(3902,261,'sections_6_intro_ctas_0_label','Explore our video selection now Explore our video selection now'),(3903,261,'_sections_6_intro_ctas_0_label','field_m11_ri_intro_ctas_label'),(3904,261,'sections_6_intro_ctas_0_url','a:3:{s:5:\"title\";s:63:\"Explore our video selection now Explore our video selection now\";s:3:\"url\";s:13:\"#testimonials\";s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";}'),(3905,261,'_sections_6_intro_ctas_0_url','field_m11_ri_intro_ctas_url'),(3906,261,'sections_6_intro_ctas_1_label','Peruse our downloadableproduct brochures Peruse our downloadableproduct brochures'),(3907,261,'_sections_6_intro_ctas_1_label','field_m11_ri_intro_ctas_label'),(3908,261,'sections_6_intro_ctas_1_url','a:3:{s:5:\"title\";s:83:\"Peruse our downloadable product brochures Peruse our downloadable product brochures\";s:3:\"url\";s:10:\"#brochures\";s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";}'),(3909,261,'_sections_6_intro_ctas_1_url','field_m11_ri_intro_ctas_url'),(3910,261,'sections_6_intro_ctas','2'),(3911,261,'_sections_6_intro_ctas','field_m11_ri_intro_ctas'),(3912,261,'sections_7_hide_section',''),(3913,261,'_sections_7_hide_section','field_m11_rt_common_settings_field_m11_cso_hide_section'),(3914,261,'sections_7_sec_id','testimonials'),(3915,261,'_sections_7_sec_id','field_m11_rt_common_settings_field_m11_cso_sec_id'),(3916,261,'sections_7_heading','TESTIMONIALS: Hear from neurosurgical experts TESTIMONIALS: Hear from neurosurgical experts'),(3917,261,'_sections_7_heading','field_m11_rt_heading'),(3918,261,'sections_7_expert_entrie