ed partnership with healthcare professionals. From problem-solving instrument sets developed with clinical experts, to ongoing support of neurosurgeons every day, Mizuho America remains committed to solutions that can help facilitate greater control, precision, and efficiency during the procedure with the goal of better outcomes after.'),(5003,267,'_sections_5_body','field_m11_abs_body'),(5004,267,'sections_5_cta_label','Explore our story'),(5005,267,'_sections_5_cta_label','field_m11_abs_cta_label'),(5006,267,'sections_5_cta_url','http://task-11.local/about-us/'),(5007,267,'_sections_5_cta_url','field_m11_abs_cta_url'),(5008,267,'sections_5_stats_0_number','30+'),(5009,267,'_sections_5_stats_0_number','field_m11_abs_stats_number'),(5010,267,'sections_5_stats_0_label','years serving the neurosurgery community'),(5011,267,'_sections_5_stats_0_label','field_m11_abs_stats_label'),(5012,267,'sections_5_stats_1_number','1,800+'),(5013,267,'_sections_5_stats_1_number','field_m11_abs_stats_number'),(5014,267,'sections_5_stats_1_label','neurosurgical\nproducts'),(5015,267,'_sections_5_stats_1_label','field_m11_abs_stats_label'),(5016,267,'sections_5_stats_2_number','1000+'),(5017,267,'_sections_5_stats_2_number','field_m11_abs_stats_number'),(5018,267,'sections_5_stats_2_label','hospitals served'),(5019,267,'_sections_5_stats_2_label','field_m11_abs_stats_label'),(5020,267,'sections_5_stats','3'),(5021,267,'_sections_5_stats','field_m11_abs_stats'),(5022,267,'sections_6_hide_section',''),(5023,267,'_sections_6_hide_section','field_m11_ri_common_settings_field_m11_cso_hide_section'),(5024,267,'sections_6_sec_id','resources-intro'),(5025,267,'_sections_6_sec_id','field_m11_ri_common_settings_field_m11_cso_sec_id'),(5026,267,'sections_6_page_title','RESOURCES'),(5027,267,'_sections_6_page_title','field_m11_ri_page_title'),(5028,267,'sections_6_heading','Watch. Read. Discover.'),(5029,267,'_sections_6_heading','field_m11_ri_heading'),(5030,267,'sections_6_body','Welcome to the Mizuho America library for neurosurgeons. From testimonials by renowned leaders in the field to product brochures, we’ve curated a collection of resources that will introduce you to our wide selection of neurosurgical devices—designed to help you overcome obstacles, fill instrumentation gaps, and refine and elevate surgical techniques.'),(5031,267,'_sections_6_body','field_m11_ri_body'),(5032,267,'sections_6_featured_video_thumbnail','259'),(5033,267,'_sections_6_featured_video_thumbnail','field_m11_ri_featured_video_thumbnail'),(5034,267,'sections_6_featured_video_url','#video-intro-lawton'),(5035,267,'_sections_6_featured_video_url','field_m11_ri_featured_video_url'),(5036,267,'sections_6_featured_quote','“When you have the right instruments in your hand, then you can just focus on the task and you can focus on, you know, battling that disease and getting the job done.”'),(5037,267,'_sections_6_featured_quote','field_m11_ri_featured_quote'),(5038,267,'sections_6_featured_quote_attribution','Michael T. Lawton, MD'),(5039,267,'_sections_6_featured_quote_attribution','field_m11_ri_featured_quote_attribution'),(5040,267,'sections_6_intro_ctas_0_label','Explore our video selection now'),(5041,267,'_sections_6_intro_ctas_0_label','field_m11_ri_intro_ctas_label'),(5042,267,'sections_6_intro_ctas_0_url','a:3:{s:3:\"url\";s:13:\"#testimonials\";s:5:\"title\";s:31:\"Explore our video selection now\";s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";}'),(5043,267,'_sections_6_intro_ctas_0_url','field_m11_ri_intro_ctas_url'),(5044,267,'sections_6_intro_ctas_1_label','Peruse our downloadable\nproduct brochures'),(5045,267,'_sections_6_intro_ctas_1_label','field_m11_ri_intro_ctas_label'),(5046,267,'sections_6_intro_ctas_1_url','a:3:{s:3:\"url\";s:10:\"#brochures\";s:5:\"title\";s:41:\"Peruse our downloadable product brochures\";s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";}'),(5047,267,'_sections_6_intro_ctas_1_url','field_m11_ri_intro_ctas_url'),(5048,267,'sections_6_intro_ctas','2'),(5049,267,'_sections_6_intro_ctas','fie